# Searchle embedding models — built locally via server/searchle/tools/*,
# ~125MB. Exceeds GitHub's 100MB limit; never commit.
# (Negates the generic `data/` rule above so target-words.json IS tracked.)
!server/searchle/data/
server/searchle/data/models/
server/searchle/data/fasttext/

# Word-bank build inputs are vendored sources and must be committed so
# `npm run build:word-bank` reproduces public/word-bank.json anywhere.
!server/games/data/
